        "sid": "AMO 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw the Lord standing by the altar. He gave the command: “Strike the tops of the temple columns so hard that the whole porch will shake. Break them off and let them fall on the heads of the people. I will kill the rest of the people in war. No one will get away; not one will escape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if they dig their way down to the world of the dead, I will catch them. Even if they climb up to heaven, I will bring them down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they hide on the top of Mount Carmel, I will search for them and catch them. If they hide from me at the bottom of the sea, I will command the sea monster",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sea monster",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": It was believed that the sea was inhabited by a great monster. This creature, like all others, was regarded as under God's control.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to bite them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they are taken away into captivity by their enemies, I will order them to be put to death. I am determined to destroy them, not to help them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “People of Israel, I think as much of the people of Ethiopia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ethiopia",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": See Word List.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " as I do of you. I brought the Philistines from Crete and the Syrians from Kir, just as I brought you from Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am watching this sinful kingdom of Israel, and I will destroy it from the face of the earth. But I will not destroy all the descendants of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will give the command and shake the people of Israel like corn in a sieve. I will shake them among the nations to remove all who are worthless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sinners among my people will be killed in war — all those who say, ‘God will not let any harm come near us.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.15.16+ACT.15.17+ACT.15.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 15.16–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “A day is coming when I will restore the kingdom of David, which is like a house fallen into ruins. I will repair its walls and restore it. I will rebuild it and make it as it was long ago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so the people of Israel will conquer what is left of the land of Edom and all the nations that were once mine,” says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", who will cause this to happen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
